%% Sequence 09 — Update profile skill
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: profile owner adds one skill to current profile.
%% Evidence status: Implemented; aggregate recalculation is downstream review/profile work.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OWNER as Profile owner
    participant C as «boundary» AddProfileSkillController
    participant K as «control» AddUserSkillCommand
    participant P as «control» proficiencyFrameworkPublicApi
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL
    participant A as «control» AuditPublicApi
    participant E as «control» Adonis emitter

    OWNER->>C: POST skill and proficiency level
    activate C
    C->>K: handle(AddUserSkillDTO)
    activate K
    K->>D: Resolve active skill or create custom skill
    activate D
    D-->>K: Canonical skill
    deactivate D
    K->>P: mapCodeToLevel(proficiencyCode)
    activate P
    P-->>K: Canonical proficiency level
    deactivate P
    K->>D: Reject duplicate and create imported user_skill
    activate D
    D-->>K: User skill persisted
    deactivate D
    K->>A: write(add_skill audit)
    activate A
    A-->>K: Audit persisted
    deactivate A
    K->>E: emit skill:score:updated
    E-->>K: Event queued
    K-->>C: User skill record
    deactivate K
    C-->>OWNER: Updated profile skill
    deactivate C
